      "caption": "execve reaches load_elf_binary through the binfmt handler list.",
      "narration": "The execve syscall builds a linux_binprm, reads the first bytes, and asks each registered binary format handler. The ELF handler is load_elf_binary in fs/binfmt_elf.c.",
