          "at": 3600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 11000,
      "caption": "Userspace begins at the interpreter's entry, not at your _start.",
      "narration": "With an interpreter present, the kernel starts the thread at ld.so's entry point. It relocates itself, mmaps each DT_NEEDED library, and applies relocations.",
